x.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $1.7 billion in FY2025, 2.5% of revenue, against 1.3% in FY2020.","cites":["IBM.sbc.2025","IBM.revenue.2025","IBM.sbc.2020","IBM.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $6.3 billion in dividends. No share repurchase is tagged for the year.","cites":["IBM.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $17.1 billion, up 4.7% from $16.3 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["IBM.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","IBM.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $69.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), net income to $11.2 billion.","cites":["IBM.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","IBM.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","IBM.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","IBM.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","IBM.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","IBM.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","IBM.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","IBM.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","IBM.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","IBM.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $14.7 billion: operating cash flow of $15.8 billion less capital spending of $1.2 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["IBM.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","IBM.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","IBM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","IBM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","IBM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","IBM.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","IBM.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","IBM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","IBM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","IBM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $71 billion at the end of FY2025, against $63 billion a year earlier. That is 105.1% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["IBM.rpo.2025","IBM.rpo.2024","IBM.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $16.1 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $13.9 billion a year earlier.","cites":["IBM.deferred.2025","IBM.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $653 million, after $692 million in FY2024.","cites":["IBM.restructuring.2025","IBM.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $13.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $830 million in short-term investments, and $67.7 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligationsCurrent + ShortTermBorrowings). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $53.3 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["IBM.cash.2025","IBM.sti.2025","IBM.debtLong.2025","IBM.debtCurrent.2025","IBM.debtShort.2025"]}]},"fin":{"IBM":{}},"quotes":{}}